      "subject": "הלוא",
      "rationale": "Tok askim bilong Hibru wantaim 'no' — mi tanim 'a, mi no inap no' bilong kaunim olsem olsem askim narapela."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "Rechab na Baana",
      "rationale": "David i toktok dairekt long tupela man we ol i kilim Isboshet."
    },
